# Density Compare
# Sodium (Na) — real density 0.971 g/cm³. equal masses: Sodium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Sodium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 20.2mm color: #ab5cf2 at (-20mm, 10.1mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 7.7 g — the water cube is the reference
